  234016: "<table><tr><td><b class=\"q4\">Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight</b><br>Binds when picked up<br>Unique-Equipped: Signet Ring of the Bronze Dragonflight (1)<table class=\"w\"><tr><td>Finger</td><th></th></tr></table><span>+6 Stamina</span><br><span>+7 Intellect</span></td></tr></table><table><tr><td>Requires Level 60<br>Requires Brood of Nozdormu - Neutral<br><span class=\"q2\">Equip: Improves your chance to hit by 1.0%.</span><br><span class=\"q2\">Equip: Increases damage and healing done by magical spells and effects by up to <span>21</span>.</span><br><span class=\"q2\">Equip: Increases the casting speed of your spells by 2% per piece of Timeworn armor equipped.</span><br><span class=\"q\">&quot;The Path of the Invoker&quot;</span></td></tr></table>",
